iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"上海市市场监督管理局 关于印发《关于促进互联网平台 广告规范健康发展的指导意见》的通知","url":"https://scjgj.sh.gov.cn/cmsres/67/67cb528172ad416e97c12c755a758cf7/0e84e4b249c7932898a6f49659df17b5.pdf","normalizedUrl":"https://scjgj.sh.gov.cn/cmsres/67/67cb528172ad416e97c12c755a758cf7/0e84e4b249c7932898a6f49659df17b5.pdf","domain":"scjgj.sh.gov.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"上海市市场监督管理局关于印发《关于促进互联网平台广告规范健康发展的指导意见》的通知","url":"https://scjgj.sh.gov.cn/207/20260109/2c984a729b92b990019ba06d36224232.html","normalizedUrl":"https://scjgj.sh.gov.cn/207/20260109/2c984a729b92b990019ba06d36224232.html","domain":"scjgj.sh.gov.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-c71ff766844945c881016f27e56a8488","q":"CMCR-Q0068","question":"AI 一键成片适合做电商广告素材吗？","day":2,"repeat":1,"valid":true,"answer":"# ✅结论：**适合，但更适合素材测试、批量变体、长尾品/标品信息流；不建议直接一键生成就投放，也不适合高端品牌主TVC**\nAI一键成片是电商广告的**素材生产工具**，不是直接拿来投放的成品。\n\n## ✅优势（什么时候非常好用）\n1. **低成本快速批量测素材**\n新品不知道什么钩子、卖点能跑，AI几十分钟出多条不同脚本、风格的短视频，小额投放快速测试CTR，不用等实拍、模特、拍摄周期。大促期间，素材消耗快，适合快速产出大量素材变体，延长广告生命周期。\n2. **适合标品、日用品、小配件**\n家居小物、收纳、小家电、3C配件、日用品等**功能型产品**，重点展示卖点、使用效果，AI素材投放数据经常不错；只用上传商品图就能生成数字人口播、场景演示视频，大幅降低拍摄成本。\n3. **长尾SKU低成本覆盖**\n很多销量一般的SKU，单独实拍成本太高。AI一键成片可以低成本产出基础视频，维持店铺内容和广告素材供给。\n4. **多平台自动适配**\n自动生成竖屏短视频（抖音/快手/小红书）、淘宝逛逛、视频号尺寸，自带字幕、配音、背景音乐，新手也能快速上手。\n\n## ⚠️短板（哪些场景慎用）\n1. **产品容易变形失真**\nAI自主生成画面时，包装、logo、产品颜色、细节容易出错。**最佳方案：把实拍商品图作为基底，AI只做场景、转场、B-roll，不要完全让AI凭空生成产品**。\n2. **强真实感品类效果差**\n服饰穿搭、美妆上脸、食品、奢侈品这类看重真人质感、皮肤/面料真实触感的品类，纯AI成片转化率通常弱于真人实拍，数字人容易有恐怖谷效应，用户一眼识别AI素材，信任度下降。\n3. **同质化风险**\n一键成片很容易生成大量相似镜头，全部直接投放会被平台判定素材同质化，广告起量困难。必须人工修改钩子、文案、镜头顺序做差异化。\n4. **合规、版权风险**\nAI生成字幕有错别字、夸大宣传词；背景音乐、素材版权需要确认商用授权；广告法违规词（最、第一、特效）AI不会自动严格校验，**人工审核是必选项**。\n\n## 📌推荐电商落地工作流（最稳）\n1. 准备**实拍高清商品图**（固定产品，避免AI扭曲商品），写清楚核心卖点、人群、广告钩子\n2. AI一键成片，批量产出3–10条初稿\n3. **人工校对**：检查产品、字幕、广告词合规性，微调开头钩子、剪辑节奏\n4. 小预算投放测试，选出跑量好的版本，再迭代变体；差的直接淘汰\n5. 爆款素材可以再用实拍重新翻拍放大投放\n\n## 一句话总结\nAI一键成片**适合做电商广告素材的“素材工厂”**，用来快速测试创意、批量产出备选素材；**初稿不能直接上大额投放**。功能标品优先用；美妆、服装、高端品牌建议AI素材做测试，主力爆量素材还是真人实拍。\n\n\n要不要我给你一套电商一键成片直接复制的提示词模板（卖点+钩子+镜头要求）？","answerHash":"52d1433f1e1e60c94600a05370029eb2c62ae765d3ab782d293fcabfc9cde2c2","finishedAt":"2026-10-13","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"火山引擎-你的AI云","url":"https://www.volcengine.com/product/kickart","normalizedUrl":"https://www.volcengine.com/product/kickart","domain":"www.volcengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"小云雀-营销成片Agent-产品介绍--即梦AI-火山引擎","url":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/85621/2306244?lang=zh","normalizedUrl":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/85621/2306244?lang=zh","domain":"www.volcengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"电商带货提速神器！一张图就能生成剧情广告～#电商 #618好物节 #小云雀AI#小云雀你的营销搭子 #小云雀AI一键搞定电商带货","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7651931209291266033","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7651931209291266033","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"产品介绍--智能创作云-火山引擎","url":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/6664/2119705","normalizedUrl":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/6664/2119705","domain":"www.volcengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"AI浪潮下:有人真赚到，有人被“收割”_新黄河","url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7695954784704020992/","normalizedUrl":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7695954784704020992/","domain":"m.toutiao.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"随手拍的图5秒就能变爆款！AI时代的“电商摄影棚”真的来了 #火山引擎  #火山引擎智能视频云  #AIGC电商万创 #科技改变生活","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7571070763168451867","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7571070763168451867","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"AI一键成片怎么做?如何用AI一键成片快速产出带货短视频? – CloudKOL","url":"https://www.cloudkol.com/archives/1534.html","normalizedUrl":"https://www.cloudkol.com/archives/1534.html","domain":"www.cloudkol.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"一键生成产品视频:跨境电商卖家的AI视频工具实操指南_跨境电商_胖嘟嘟SEO_InfoQ写作社区","url":"https://xie.infoq.cn/article/d9bfdbf4df69f3293872c3295","normalizedUrl":"https://xie.infoq.cn/article/d9bfdbf4df69f3293872c3295","domain":"xie.infoq.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"产品介绍--智能创作云-火山引擎","url":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/6664/2119705","normalizedUrl":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/6664/2119705","domain":"www.volcengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"商品广告AI一键成片","url":"https://www.iqinghu.com/agent/details/132","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iqinghu.com/agent/details/132","domain":"www.iqinghu.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"当 AI 扑进剪辑软件:视频创作的“专业权”正在被重新分配_蓝鲸新闻","url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7695972182858269199/","normalizedUrl":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7695972182858269199/","domain":"m.toutiao.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"AI Video Ads for Ecommerce — A Realistic Editorial Guide | Toolstacker","url":"https://toolstacker.io/blog/ai-video-ads-for-ecommerce","normalizedUrl":"https://toolstacker.io/blog/ai-video-ads-for-ecommerce","domain":"toolstacker.io","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-478f4b5b4c294724b1b407afcacf0166","q":"CMCR-Q0068","question":"AI 一键成片适合做电商广告素材吗？","day":2,"repeat":2,"valid":true,"answer":"# ✅ 结论：**适合做批量测品、投流测试素材，但不适合直接拿来当高端品牌主广告，必须人工审核+少量后期**\nAI一键成片是电商千川/信息流素材的**量产工具**，不是一键出爆款成品。\n\n## ✅ 优势（电商最看重的点）\n1. **低成本、极速批量生产**：上传产品图+卖点，几分钟出多条不同版本，快速搭建素材池，适合新品测款、多版本A/B测试，不用租场地、模特、拍摄团队。\n2. **零基础可用**：自带电商模板（口播、种草、产品展示、数字人带货），自动适配9:16短视频比例，自动生成字幕、BGM、脚本。\n3. **快速变体扩量**：同一个产品一键生成多种风格、不同钩子开头，专门解决投流后期素材枯竭的痛点。\n\n## ⚠️ 短板与风险（一定要重视）\n1. **画面真实性风险（最大坑）**\nAI容易把产品形状、颜色、细节生成错误。**产品主体建议用实拍图，AI只用来做氛围、场景、转场**；不能完全靠AI生成商品外观，否则会涉嫌虚假宣传，面临处罚、售后纠纷。\n2. **文案、字幕、口播容易出错**\n会出现错别字、夸大功效、极限词（最、第一、根治等），**每一条必须人工审核广告合规**，食品/美妆/保健品尤其严格。\n3. **同质化严重**\n大量商家都在用同类模板，AI感重，跑久了容易流量衰减，很难做出高质感品牌TVC。\n4. **版权与平台AI标识**\n背景音乐、素材、数字人肖像存在侵权隐患；平台要求AI生成内容按规则标注，不标注会限流或违规。\n\n## 📌 最佳使用场景\n### 推荐用\n- 新品冷启动，批量生成多条短视频做投流测素材\n- 日用品、小百货、配饰等标准实物，侧重场景种草\n- 跨境短视频、商品详情页短介绍视频\n- 快速替换文案、换BGM，批量变体扩素材\n\n### 不推荐直接全AI成片\n- 高客单价品牌TVC、品牌首页主广告\n- 美妆、保健品、医疗器械（功效宣传红线极高）\n- 需要精准展示产品细节、实测效果的强转化素材\n\n## ✅ 安全落地工作流（推荐）\n1. 准备**实拍产品原图**（多角度），作为AI的参考底图，锁定产品外观\n2. 输入经过合规检查的卖点脚本，规避极限词\n3. AI一键成片，生成3–5个版本\n4. **人工审核三步**：产品是否失真、文案有没有违规、画面有无侵权元素\n5. 简单二次剪辑微调钩子、字幕，必要时叠加实拍产品特写\n6. 投放时按平台要求标注AI生成内容\n\n\n\n如果你需要，我可以给你一套**AI一键成片专用电商提示词模板**（直接复制，自带合规检查要点）。","answerHash":"51f26ed2fca76e37f2f5b9b46658c5a0acdee3e672db7bad83804bc509c2b290","finishedAt":"2026-10-14","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"Kling Omni 多模态 AI 视频 | A2E AI Video Platform","url":"https://video.a2e.com.cn/kling-video-omni","normalizedUrl":"https://video.a2e.com.cn/kling-video-omni","domain":"video.a2e.com.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"火山引擎-你的AI云","url":"https://www.volcengine.com/product/kickart","normalizedUrl":"https://www.volcengine.com/product/kickart","domain":"www.volcengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"爆款广告能不能一键生成？ #ai实战技巧 #电商ai工具 #美图设计室","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7676338642986522216","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7676338642986522216","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"电商带货提速神器！一张图就能生成剧情广告～#电商 #618好物节 #小云雀AI#小云雀你的营销搭子 #小云雀AI一键搞定电商带货","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7651931209291266033","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7651931209291266033","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"做千川投流还在为素材头疼？美图设计室AI一键复刻爆款！#美图设计室  #电商视频  #千川素材  #AI带货  #AI工具","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7675677378391149870","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7675677378391149870","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"电商 AI 营销创作 - 一键生成图文视频工具- 阿里云","url":"https://www.aliyun.com/benefit/aiuse/e-commerce","normalizedUrl":"https://www.aliyun.com/benefit/aiuse/e-commerce","domain":"www.aliyun.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"AI一键成片怎么做?如何用AI一键成片快速产出带货短视频? – CloudKOL","url":"https://www.cloudkol.com/archives/1534.html","normalizedUrl":"https://www.cloudkol.com/archives/1534.html","domain":"www.cloudkol.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"新浪财经的微博","url":"https://m.weibo.cn/detail/5320486007341494","normalizedUrl":"https://m.weibo.cn/detail/5320486007341494","domain":"m.weibo.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"AIGC全链路电商素材生产的应用与挑战","url":"https://pdf.hanspub.org/ecl_2316686.pdf","normalizedUrl":"https://pdf.hanspub.org/ecl_2316686.pdf","domain":"pdf.hanspub.org","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"AI“一键成片”，是创新还是侵权?--社会·法治--人民网","url":"http://society.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0513/c1008-40478667.html","normalizedUrl":"http://society.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0513/c1008-40478667.html","domain":"society.people.com.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"当 AI 扑进剪辑软件:视频创作的“专业权”正在被重新分配_蓝鲸新闻","url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7695972182858269199/","normalizedUrl":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7695972182858269199/","domain":"m.toutiao.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"AI带货视频“批量化”生产 “AI李鬼”游走在灰色地带_光明网","url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7576459842060976690/","normalizedUrl":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7576459842060976690/","domain":"m.toutiao.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-c9d17c80a9b8444d9c93f29b1ee6531f","q":"CMCR-Q0068","question":"AI 一键成片适合做电商广告素材吗？","day":2,"repeat":3,"valid":true,"answer":"# ✅ 结论\n**AI一键成片非常适合用来做电商广告的测试素材、批量二创素材，但不建议直接把纯AI全自动成片当作主力跑量素材**。最佳模式：**AI成片 + 人工微调/实拍素材混合使用**。\n\n## ✔ 适合的场景（优势）\n1. **快速测品、批量起素材**\n只需要上传产品图、输入卖点，几分钟一次性产出多条不同脚本、风格、口播版本的短视频，低成本做A/B测试，快速验证哪个卖点、开头抓眼球，不用租场地、模特、摄影师。适合新品冷启动、多SKU、季节性促销素材。\n2. **爆款素材裂变二创**\n把已经跑起来的实拍爆款素材丢进去，AI自动改写分镜、换口播、换BGM，批量衍生大量变体素材，延长爆款生命周期，这是电商投手最常用的用法。\n3. **低成本补充素材库**\n做商品卡、信息流、小红书种草、主图短视频，快速补齐大量素材，降低内容制作成本，适合中小商家、预算有限的店铺。\n4. **平台原生工具合规度高**\n像巨量即创这类平台内置一键成片，生成的数字人、音乐版权一般支持商用投放，广告审核通过率相对更高。\n\n## ❌ 短板与风险（重点）\n1. **纯AI成片信任度偏弱，转化上限一般**\nAI容易出现产品变形、光影违和、人物五官/手部崩坏，缺少真实使用体验。高客单价、美妆、食品、母婴这类强信任品类，纯AI素材转化普遍不如真人实拍素材，退货风险也可能更高。\n2. **同质化，容易被平台识别低质**\n大量批量生成的AI素材画面套路接近，容易被判定同质化，后期跑量能力下滑，很难长期稳定跑出高ROI。\n3. **合规风险**\nAI生成内容需要**按平台规则标注AI创作**；如果用第三方免费工具，务必确认商用授权，无授权素材会广告拒审，甚至违规限流。\n4. **细节不可控**\n产品细节、文字、包装LOGO容易出错，直接投放会引发客诉。**每条AI成片投放前必须人工检查产品是否失真**。\n\n## 📌 实操建议\n1. **策略分层**\n- 测试层：AI一键成片，小预算批量测创意、卖点，筛选出潜力脚本；\n- 主力跑量层：把AI验证有效的脚本，改成实拍/实拍+AI镜头混合成片，放大投放。\n2. **成片后人工二次编辑**\n修改AI口播文案、替换失真画面、微调节奏，不要完全不修改直接上广告。\n3. **品类选择参考**\n✅ 更友好：家居摆件、3C配件、收纳、简单日用品，重在展示外观；\n⚠️ 谨慎纯AI投放：食品、美妆护肤、母婴、服饰（需要展示上身、真实肤感、食用体验）、高客单价产品。\n4. **版权与审核**\n优先选择平台官方AI一键成片工具；第三方工具务必确认商用授权，投放前做好AI内容标注。\n","answerHash":"3ad09f218b2213caff22f671eb3dde9a50484ada7e2425b3b9d573a39c40cfe9","finishedAt":"2026-10-14","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"爆款广告能不能一键生成？ #ai实战技巧 #电商ai工具 #美图设计室","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7676338642986522216","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7676338642986522216","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"火山引擎-你的AI云","url":"https://www.volcengine.com/product/kickart","normalizedUrl":"https://www.volcengine.com/product/kickart","domain":"www.volcengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"电商带货提速神器！一张图就能生成剧情广告～#电商 #618好物节 #小云雀AI#小云雀你的营销搭子 #小云雀AI一键搞定电商带货","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7651931209291266033","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7651931209291266033","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"ufc竞彩app官网入口发布AI营销视频引擎ViperCut，上线首周获3000企业用户验证_齐鲁晚报网","url":"https://m.qlwb.com.cn/Rgc/wiki/xNJaKhfG/","normalizedUrl":"https://m.qlwb.com.cn/Rgc/wiki/xNJaKhfG/","domain":"m.qlwb.com.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"小云雀-营销成片Agent-产品介绍--即梦AI-火山引擎","url":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/85621/2306244?lang=zh","normalizedUrl":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/85621/2306244?lang=zh","domain":"www.volcengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"AI Video Ads for E-Commerce: Creating Scroll-Stopping Content Automatically","url":"https://www.byteplus.com/en/topic/578723","normalizedUrl":"https://www.byteplus.com/en/topic/578723","domain":"www.byteplus.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"产品介绍--Kickart-火山引擎","url":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/6664/2119705?lang=zh","normalizedUrl":"https://www.volcengine.com/docs/6664/2119705?lang=zh","domain":"www.volcengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"10天教会你全域投放 （6）AIGC会不会对视频素材有影响？#投放 #抖音电商知识分享","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667032854710324523","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667032854710324523","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"老商家都在用AI，却没人告诉你真相。这篇文章思路如果对你有用，点赞收藏，图文详细版已放粉丝群，需要自取。#抖店运营 #抖店干货 #AI #厌夏的风电商笔记","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7619836561030531171","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7619836561030531171","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"调查 | AI渗透电商全链路，红利还是陷阱? | 